# 1. DEFINITIONS

"Project"
Refers to the POBLATION game, launcher, repository, releases, codebase, templates, tools, and associated materials.

"Official Build"
Refers to a build published directly by the POBLATION Project through official GitHub releases or official distribution channels.

"Modified Build"
Refers to any build containing modified, patched, extended, altered, forked, or transformed project code.

"Fan Build"
Refers to a noncommercial modified build clearly identified as unofficial and transformative.

"Commercial Use"
Refers to any activity involving:
- direct sales
- subscriptions
- paid access
- ad revenue
- sponsorship revenue
- paywalls
- crypto/NFT integration
- paid launcher distribution
- selling modified builds
- monetized mirrors
- commercial redistribution
- competing storefronts
- monetized services using the project

"Official Branding"
Includes:
- the name "POBLATION"
- official logos
- official launcher visuals
- official icons
- official splash screens
- official UI identity
- official slogans/taglines

